# Cursor IDE AI Rules
This workspace is the Universal Multimodal End-to-End Analysis Suite for Images, Videos, and Websites.
Always read setup/rules/AGENTS.md for full agent protocols.

Whenever inspecting or analyzing:
- Images: run `python core/launchers/analyze.py image <path>`
- Videos: run `python core/launchers/analyze.py video <path>`
- Websites: run `python core/launchers/analyze.py website <url>`
- Routing: run `python core/launchers/analyze.py route "<prompt>"`
- Diagnostics: run `python core/launchers/analyze.py doctor`

Cross-platform compatible with Windows, macOS, and Linux. Never hallucinate visual details, colors, speech, or layout responsiveness without running the analyzers.
